flowchart TB
    User["End User / Evaluator"]
    WebUI["Catalist Web Application (React + Vite)"]
    BackendAPI["Backend API (FastAPI / Modular Monolith)"]
    Postgres[("PostgreSQL 16 + pgvector\n(Transcripts, Turns, Embeddings, Memory)")]
    Ollama["Local LLM (Ollama / llama3.2)"]
    Gemini["Hosted LLM (Optional Gemini Free Tier)"]
    LangSmith["LangSmith Tracing (Optional Developer Telemetry)"]

    User -->|Views status, submits questions, reviews briefs| WebUI
    WebUI -->|REST / JSON API with Request IDs| BackendAPI
    BackendAPI -->|SQLAlchemy / psycopg3 - Hybrid Queries| Postgres
    BackendAPI -->|Offline / Local Inference| Ollama
    BackendAPI -.->|Optional Cloud Inference| Gemini
    BackendAPI -.->|Metadata & Run Traces (No raw transcripts)| LangSmith
